1069	
1070	    Args:
1071	        last: Number of recent commits to squash (default: 10)
1072	        mode: Squash mode - 'soft' creates backup ref, 'hard' does not (default: soft)
1073	        message: Optional message for the squashed commit
1074	        include_merges: Whether to include merge commits in the squash
1075	        path: Optional path to the GAIT repository
